name=Auto Door Remote
id=AutoDoorRemote
description=Turn vanilla garage doors and fence gates into remote-controlled auto doors. Craft a remote control, right-click a door to install and pair it - the motor unit is placed on the ground next to the door - one remote can pair many doors, and you can remove the opener at any time. Keep the remote in your inventory and press the Period key (rebindable) to open or close your doors from the driver's seat, no need to get out of the car. Locked doors still need their original key.
